# Qoduck — findings by Inkling 2 Small

- Source: Alibaba / Qoder (stealth picker entry `Qoduck`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qoduck (stealth model, identity undisclosed by Alibaba/Qoder)
- **Short description:** Anonymous stealth coding model inside Alibaba's Qoder (International) platform, launched 2026-11-07. Qoder states its identity "has yet to be disclosed". Community speculation points at Qwen 4 (tokenizer quirks match Qwen's; Qoder price parity with Qwen3.8-Max; optional 1M-token window) — none of this is confirmed by Alibaba, and the name has been withdrawn after the promo window.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder International (individual accounts only; Teams/Enterprise ineligible) — model picker entry `Qoduck`. Free daily allowance during the promo 2026-11-07 → 2026-11-11 10:00 (UTC+8), then removed from the picker ("Qoduck will be removed when the promotion ends"). After the promo, standard Credit rate 0.5×. Not available via API, OpenCode Zen, OpenRouter, or pay-per-token.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-11-07 (Qoder International picker). Removed from the picker 2026-11-11. No knowledge cutoff disclosed.
- **IDs:** `Qoduck` (Qoder International picker only). No API ID, no weights, no listing in public gateways verified.
- **Context window:** 1M tokens reported by users (unconfirmed by Alibaba); Qoder picker lists no spec.
- **Modalities:** text / coding (Qoder coding IDE context) in → text out; high thinking intensity supported (0.0× credits within promo); tools inside Qoder agent. Image/video input unconfirmed.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** free daily allowance during promo (ended); otherwise 0.5× Qoder Credits. No public per-token price. Individual Qoder accounts only.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed — no parameters, no weights, no license.

### Raw benchmarks found

ZERO verified public benchmark numbers found for `Qoduck` (the exact picker ID). What exists:

- Qoder official event page: identity undisclosed; no specs, no benchmarks, no end-of-life notes beyond promo end (2026-11-11); individual users only.
- Community/tester claims (X/blog coverage): tokenizer quirks match Qwen's; "beat every released Qwen on a knowledge check" (unsourced, single tester); pixel-art city demo faster than DeepSeek V4.1 Flash; normal Qoder price parity with Qwen3.8-Max; users can switch it to a 1M-token window. No harness, no reproducible table, no numbers accepted as evidence.
- Stealth Models: Qoduck named as unconfirmed Qwen4-family look-alike (tokenizer match is circumstantial; Arena "Kerria"/"Kalmia" sightings likewise unconfirmed) — no StealthMark entry.
- BenchLM / LLM Stats / BenchmarkList: no page / no rows (checked 2026-11-13 via search).

